{
	quest.10F0C4142CE0DBD5.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade bases turn into dozens of backpack upgrades. See the §5Chests and Drawers§r chapter."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Upgrade Base and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.10F0C4142CE0DBD5.title: "Backpack Upgrades"
	quest.12A47C8D2F696610.quest_desc: [
		"Hold the vein-mining key (default §e`§r) while breaking blocks to mine whole ore veins or chop whole trees at once. It costs a little extra hunger."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 32 x Coal and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.12A47C8D2F696610.title: "Handy Keys"
	quest.14502B5FB961713B.quest_desc: [
		"Your items wait for you in a grave where you fell. Walk up and use it to get everything back."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 64 x Torch and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.14502B5FB961713B.title: "If You Die"
	quest.15C92925388BFC18.quest_desc: [
		"Open the map with §eM§r and use the chunk-claim screen to claim land. Claimed chunks are safe from griefing and explosions, and you can force-load a few so machines keep running while you are away."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 16 x Oak Fence and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.15C92925388BFC18.title: "Protect Your Base"
	quest.16AD19EF8944F264.quest_desc: [
		"Warp plates link to each other for short hops around your base."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 2 x Warp Plate and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.16AD19EF8944F264.title: "Warp Plates"
	quest.17C5A7EAE1285CF9.quest_desc: [
		"Nine Craft is a big kitchen-sink pack: tech, magic, farming, bosses and a whole lot of building. There is no wrong way to play."
		""
		"This book is your map. Every chapter follows one mod or one theme from the very first item to its endgame. Nothing is locked behind quests, so treat them as signposts."
		""
		"§eFirst task:§r craft a crafting table so we know you're up and running."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Crafting Table and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.17C5A7EAE1285CF9.title: "§5Welcome to Nine Craft!"
	quest.19BE4CB03764EAF7.quest_desc: [
		"Hover any item and press §eR§r for recipes or §eU§r for uses. Nearly every question in a modpack can be answered this way."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Chest and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.19BE4CB03764EAF7.title: "Look Things Up"
	quest.1C59C0E12A88BC5D.quest_desc: [
		"Inventory space runs out fast. A Sophisticated Backpack is cheap and upgrades a long way. Put it on your back slot to keep your hands free."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Backpack and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.1C59C0E12A88BC5D.title: "Grab a Backpack"
	quest.1D9C19627F3EDDE9.quest_desc: [
		"Plant a few saplings near your base so you never run out of wood. Then head to §6The Main Path§r chapter!"
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 4 x Oak Sapling and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1D9C19627F3EDDE9.title: "Your First Step"
	quest.1ED8E5EDC6C4109D.quest_desc: [
		"§dNine Craft Quest Book§r"
		""
		"Every quest, description, chapter layout and piece of chapter art in this book was written and drawn for the §5Nine Craft§r modpack."
		""
		"Copyright (c) 2026 Nine Craft. All Rights Reserved."
		""
		"You may play with, edit and share this book as part of Nine Craft. Please do not copy it into other public modpacks without written permission from the Nine Craft team."
		""
		"§8This quest is hidden and only appears in edit mode.§r"
	]
	quest.1ED8E5EDC6C4109D.quest_subtitle: "Copyright (c) 2026 Nine Craft"
	quest.1ED8E5EDC6C4109D.title: "§5Nine Craft§r - Quest Book Notice"
	quest.1F973064EABB2CE9.quest_desc: [
		"Not sure where to go next? The §5Main Path§r chapter walks you from your first stone pick to the late game, pointing into the mod chapters along the way."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Compass and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1F973064EABB2CE9.title: "Follow the Main Path"
	quest.22EB1F42A10865C9.quest_desc: [
		"Quests with a §dhexagon§r border are milestones. Optional quests are side paths you can skip."
		""
		"Click a quest to read it, then click its task to hand in the items. Rewards are claimed with the button on the right. Start by crafting a book!"
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Book and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.22EB1F42A10865C9.title: "How This Book Works"
	quest.3124B53467C7565A.quest_desc: [
		"Mobs spawn in darkness. Light up your base well so nothing spawns inside."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 4 x Lantern and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.3124B53467C7565A.title: "Light It Up"
	quest.5439CB8BD18979AD.quest_desc: [
		"Quest progress is shared per team. Run §a/ftbteams party create <name>§r and invite your friends so everyone works on the same book."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make White Bed and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.5439CB8BD18979AD.title: "Playing With Friends"
	quest.54B753C744A6B228.quest_desc: [
		"Waystones link places together. Find them in villages or craft your own, then warp between them from any waystone."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Waystone and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.54B753C744A6B228.title: "Fast Travel"
